00:13:56.580 --> 00:14:23.179
That is another aspect of this mysticism. Now, I want to be more and more specific. Briefly, the mystic is the individual who, in a sense, discovers who he or she is.

00:14:26.580 --> 00:14:56.539
More precise, the mystic is the one who forges him or herself. Let me explain. For the mythical mind, for the primitive, for those

00:14:56.539 --> 00:15:21.940
who do not face reality and rationality, to always think about some idyllic past, the paradise in the past, oh, how beautiful things were when I was a child. Always a past, a past.

